{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ngNu8YJQHn1795390458.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>荃灣大壩街清晨爆鹹水管，水柱一度高達10米。</p><p></p><p>鹹水由地底湧出行人路，部分流出行車路。警方指，該條地下鹹水管於清晨約5時爆裂，水柱一度高達10米，水浸面積約15米乘5米。水務署人員到場閂水掣及進行維修。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.624927+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.714553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:37:14.607123+00:00","content_hash":"e6392c55e5032f182542997056ae5c59f948f86b7cbd5d4fb8fa78573ae91847","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.624927+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}